// BT-3963 (ADR 0135 §2): a static supervisor whose `childSpecs` depends on its
// start args. `supervise` starts it with `nil` args, so it gets one worker.

Supervisor subclass: Bt3963ArgsSup

  childSpecs => self args isNil ifTrue: [#(Bt3963Worker)] ifFalse: [#()]
